          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Access</strong> You're from Druma.</p><hr /><p>You have entered the ranks of the Mercenary League and now wear the black uniform that's the source of the organization's popular epithet. You become trained in Intimidation; if you were already trained, you become an expert instead. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Additional Lore] skill feat for Warfare Lore; if you were already trained in Warfare Lore, you also become trained in a Lore skill of your choice. While wearing medium or heavy armor, you gain a +1 circumstance bonus to Intimidation checks.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.journals.JournalEntry.vx5FGEG34AxI2dow.JournalEntryPage.irUrG1k3AJ0OfW9b]{Blackjacket}</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 2
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "trained in medium armor and martial weapons"
              }
            ]
          },
