          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You have completed your active course of action but haven't Dismissed it or chosen a new one.</p><hr /><p>You're bolstered when a plan comes together. You Dismiss your current course of action and gain 15 temporary Hit Points that last for 1 hour. The number of temporary Hit Points increases by 5 at 12th level and every 2 levels thereafter.</p>"
