      "id": "nLFP7rT0jhM11nFR",
      "name": "Lead by Example",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "nLFP7rT0jhM11nFR",
        "folder": "eLN5fg0dn0xdQGZZ",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Lead by Example",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "action"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You telegraph your next attack to let your allies in on your strategy. Make a melee or ranged Strike with a –2 circumstance penalty. On a hit, the next ally to target the same creature with a Strike gains a +2 circumstance bonus to their attack roll. On a critical hit, the bonus applies to any allies who act before the start of your next turn.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Lead by Example]</p>"
